<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Southcorp says early 96/7 is positive.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Southcorp says early 96/7 is positive.</headline>
<dateline>ADELAIDE 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wine, packaging, and appliance manufacturer Southcorp Holdings Ltd said on Friday that its operating performance in the first four months of 1996/97 continued the positve trend of the 1956/96 fourth quarter. (c) Reuters Limited 1996</p>
</text>
